# Quisirella — Audience & Placement

Doc truoc: `config/store_profile.yaml` (price_tiers, advertising, audience).

## Danh muc quang cao vs ban hang IG

| Kenh | Hang / san pham |
|---|---|
| **Meta Ads (danh muc QC)** | **Tiffany & Co.** (chu yeu), **Bvlgari** |
| **IG organic (khong ads)** | **Justin Davis** — chi dang bai ban, khong chay quang cao |

Justin Davis **khong nam trong danh muc quang cao**. Khong de xuat chay ads Justin Davis, khong danh gia hieu qua ads theo Justin Davis.

## Map audience → tier gia (chi ap dung cho ads: Tiffany/Bvlgari)

| Tier | Gia (VND) | Ads quang ba |
|---|---|---|
| tier_1 | 2 – 4 trieu | Tiffany Elsa Peretti |
| tier_2 | 4 – 10 trieu | Tiffany 1837/RTT, Bvlgari Save the Children |
| tier_3 | 10 trieu+ | Tiffany HardWear, RTT, vang/kim cuong, Bvlgari |

_(Justin Davis thuoc tier 1–2 ve gia nhung ban qua IG organic — ngoai pham vi phan tich Meta Ads.)_

## Gioi tinh — phu ca nu va nam

| Gioi tinh | Vai tro | Targeting |
|---|---|---|
| **Nu** | Tep chinh, da so khach mua trang suc | Uu tien spend, creative Tiffany nu tinh / classic |
| **Nam** | Thieu so nhung **co conversion** — qua tang, street-luxury | **Giu** — khong loai bo, khong cat budget ve 0 |

**Quy tac phan tich breakdown gioi tinh:**
- Bao cao spend%, CTR, CPC **ca nu va nam**
- Nu thuong chiem spend nhieu hon — binh thuong
- Nam co CPC thap hon hoac chi phi/tin nhan tot → **giu hoac test tang**, khong discard
- **Cam de xuat:** "chi target nu", "loai nam", "nam khong relevant"

## Breakdown bat buoc (file 02)

- **Tuoi:** spend%, impressions, CTR, CPC → gan tier (Tiffany/Bvlgari)
- **Gioi tinh:** bang day du female / male / unknown — nhan xet ca hai
- **Placement:** spend%, CTR, CPC theo platform_position

## Placement rules (IG-first)

| Placement | Vai tro | Hanh dong |
|---|---|---|
| Instagram Feed | Showcase macro Tiffany (chi tiet, tem, hop) | **Giu** |
| Instagram Reels | Video ngan macro, reach rong | **Uu tien** neu CPC thap |
| Instagram Stories | Swipe → DM | **Review** neu CTR thap + spend cao |
| Facebook | Luxury jewelry IG-native VN | **Giam/loai** neu > 15% spend |

## Khong nen

- Loai bo hoan toan targeting nam
- De xuat quang cao Justin Davis (chi ban IG organic)
- Mo rong mass audience gia re (AOV 2tr+)
- Nham lan doanh thu/chuyen doi Justin Davis (IG) voi hieu qua ads Tiffany
